claim.claim-text:
a catheter shaft (18; 204);
an inflatable balloon (16; 202) secured to a distal portion of the catheter shaft (18; 204); and
an expandable frame (36; 100; 208; 300) disposed over the balloon (16; 202), the expandable frame (36; 100; 208; 300) including a proximal section (38; 110; 232; 320), a distal section (40; 112; 234; 322), and an intermediate section (42; 114; 236; 324), wherein the proximal section (38; 110; 232; 320) includes a coupling mechanism and is pivotably coupled to a first coupling mechanism of the intermediate section (42; 114; 236; 324) and the distal section (40; 112; 234; 322) includes a coupling mechanism that is pivotably coupled to a second coupling mechanism of the intermediate section (42; 114; 236; 324);
wherein the expandable frame includes a plurality of channels (56; 76; 146) configured to slidably receive one or more cutting members (20; 206; 306) therein.
